# React / Redux

- Functional components only
- Redux Toolkit slices in `stores/`; keep game input out of reducers
- When a modal or chat input focuses, call GameBridge to disable Phaser keys
- Do not put Redux dispatches on the Phaser per-frame path
- Campus strings come from `content/` or selectors over content — no inline building copy
- Follow DESIGN.md tokens (navy panels, mint `#33ac96` accent, z-index table)
